{"post_stream": {"posts": [{"id": 122832, "name": "David Cooper", "username": "udavidson", "avatar_template": "https://avatars.discourse-cdn.com/v4/letter/u/aad0ee/{size}.png", "created_at": "2022-11-27T00:16:13.152Z", "cooked": "<p>Hello, I noticed that when installing <code>gparted</code>, also (I think) rather unrelated packages like <code>gnome-bluetooth</code>, <code>mutter</code>, <code>gdm</code>, … will get installed, because they are listed as dependency. I don’t think this is correct. What would be the best place to report this?</p>\n<p>And is there a way to prevent these dependencies from getting installed? I tried <code>--setopt install_weak_deps=false</code> but it didn’t help in this case. Thank you!</p>", "post_number": 1, "post_type": 1, "posts_count": 6, "updated_at": "2023-06-22T15:49:16.448Z", "reply_count": 0, "reply_to_post_number": null, "quote_count": 0, "incoming_link_count": 187, "reads": 18, "readers_count": 17, "score": 953.6, "yours": false, "topic_id": 72200, "topic_slug": "gparted-dependencies", "display_username": "David Cooper", "primary_group_name": null, "flair_name": null, "flair_url": null, "flair_bg_color": null, "flair_color": null, "flair_group_id": null, "badges_granted": [], "version": 3, "can_edit": false, "can_delete": false, "can_recover": false, "can_see_hidden_post": false, "can_wiki": false, "read": true, "user_title": null, "bookmarked": false, "actions_summary": [{"id": 2, "count": 1}], "moderator": false, "admin": false, "staff": false, "user_id": 11403, "hidden": false, "trust_level": 1, "deleted_at": null, "user_deleted": false, "edit_reason": null, "can_view_edit_history": true, "wiki": false, "mentioned_users": [], "post_url": "/t/gparted-dependencies/72200/1", "event": null, "calendar_details": [], "reactions": [{"id": "heart", "type": "emoji", "count": 1}], "current_user_reaction": null, "reaction_users_count": 1, "current_user_used_main_reaction": false, "can_accept_answer": false, "can_unaccept_answer": false, "accepted_answer": false, "topic_accepted_answer": null}, {"id": 101524, "name": "ersen", "username": "ersen", "avatar_template": "https://avatars.discourse-cdn.com/v4/letter/e/db3279/{size}.png", "created_at": "2022-11-27T05:49:11.867Z", "cooked": "<p>Do you have a polkit agent installed? Because <code>PolicyKit-authentication-agent</code> is a dependency of <code>gparted</code> and that may cause to try to install some polkit agent whose dependencies are the ones you listed above.</p>", "post_number": 2, "post_type": 1, "posts_count": 6, "updated_at": "2022-11-27T06:12:12.535Z", "reply_count": 2, "reply_to_post_number": null, "quote_count": 0, "incoming_link_count": 5, "reads": 16, "readers_count": 15, "score": 38.2, "yours": false, "topic_id": 72200, "topic_slug": "gparted-dependencies", "display_username": "ersen", "primary_group_name": null, "flair_name": null, "flair_url": null, "flair_bg_color": null, "flair_color": null, "flair_group_id": null, "badges_granted": [], "version": 2, "can_edit": false, "can_delete": false, "can_recover": false, "can_see_hidden_post": false, "can_wiki": false, "read": true, "user_title": "", "bookmarked": false, "actions_summary": [], "moderator": false, "admin": false, "staff": false, "user_id": 1379, "hidden": false, "trust_level": 2, "deleted_at": null, "user_deleted": false, "edit_reason": null, "can_view_edit_history": true, "wiki": false, "mentioned_users": [], "post_url": "/t/gparted-dependencies/72200/2", "event": null, "reactions": [], "current_user_reaction": null, "reaction_users_count": 0, "current_user_used_main_reaction": false, "can_accept_answer": false, "can_unaccept_answer": false, "accepted_answer": false, "topic_accepted_answer": null}, {"id": 102701, "name": "Villy Kruse", "username": "vekruse", "avatar_template": "https://avatars.discourse-cdn.com/v4/letter/v/aad0ee/{size}.png", "created_at": "2022-11-27T06:22:00.808Z", "cooked": "<aside class=\"quote no-group\" data-username=\"ersen\" data-post=\"2\" data-topic=\"72200\">\n<div class=\"title\">\n<div class=\"quote-controls\"></div>\n<img loading=\"lazy\" alt=\"\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" src=\"https://avatars.discourse-cdn.com/v4/letter/e/db3279/48.png\" class=\"avatar\"> ersen:</div>\n<blockquote>\n<p>PolicyKit-authentication-agent</p>\n</blockquote>\n</aside>\n<p>Good question</p>\n<p><code>PolicyKit-authentication-agent</code> is a feature name which can be provided by one of these packages.</p>\n<pre><code class=\"lang-auto\">gnome-shell\nlxpolkit\nlxqt-policykit\nmate-polkit\npolkit-gnome\npolkit-kde\nxfce-polkit\n</code></pre>\n<p>You should install the one matching your desktop environment.</p>", "post_number": 3, "post_type": 1, "posts_count": 6, "updated_at": "2023-03-08T22:32:02.645Z", "reply_count": 0, "reply_to_post_number": 2, "quote_count": 1, "incoming_link_count": 3, "reads": 16, "readers_count": 15, "score": 33.2, "yours": false, "topic_id": 72200, "topic_slug": "gparted-dependencies", "display_username": "Villy Kruse", "primary_group_name": null, "flair_name": null, "flair_url": null, "flair_bg_color": null, "flair_color": null, "flair_group_id": null, "badges_granted": [], "version": 1, "can_edit": false, "can_delete": false, "can_recover": false, "can_see_hidden_post": false, "can_wiki": false, "read": true, "user_title": null, "reply_to_user": {"id": 2633, "username": "penguinnooob", "name": "Rob Smith", "avatar_template": "https://avatars.discourse-cdn.com/v4/letter/p/f5a326/{size}.png"}, "bookmarked": false, "actions_summary": [{"id": 2, "count": 1}], "moderator": false, "admin": false, "staff": false, "user_id": 8762, "hidden": false, "trust_level": 3, "deleted_at": null, "user_deleted": false, "edit_reason": null, "can_view_edit_history": true, "wiki": false, "mentioned_users": [], "post_url": "/t/gparted-dependencies/72200/3", "event": null, "reactions": [{"id": "heart", "type": "emoji", "count": 1}], "current_user_reaction": null, "reaction_users_count": 1, "current_user_used_main_reaction": false, "can_accept_answer": false, "can_unaccept_answer": false, "accepted_answer": false, "topic_accepted_answer": null}, {"id": 178013, "name": "David Cooper", "username": "udavidson", "avatar_template": "https://avatars.discourse-cdn.com/v4/letter/u/aad0ee/{size}.png", "created_at": "2022-11-27T13:09:24.670Z", "cooked": "<p>Ok, this seems likely - I have installed a polkit-agent in the meantime, and now <code>gparted</code> does not have all those dependencies anymore. Is there a quick way I could see this “dependency tree” myself, so that in future situations I would know which package introduces all those dependencies? Thank you for your help</p>", "post_number": 4, "post_type": 1, "posts_count": 6, "updated_at": "2023-03-08T07:53:58.844Z", "reply_count": 1, "reply_to_post_number": 2, "quote_count": 0, "incoming_link_count": 0, "reads": 13, "readers_count": 12, "score": 7.6, "yours": false, "topic_id": 72200, "topic_slug": "gparted-dependencies", "display_username": "David Cooper", "primary_group_name": null, "flair_name": null, "flair_url": null, "flair_bg_color": null, "flair_color": null, "flair_group_id": null, "badges_granted": [], "version": 1, "can_edit": false, "can_delete": false, "can_recover": false, "can_see_hidden_post": false, "can_wiki": false, "read": true, "user_title": null, "reply_to_user": {"id": 2633, "username": "penguinnooob", "name": "Rob Smith", "avatar_template": "https://avatars.discourse-cdn.com/v4/letter/p/f5a326/{size}.png"}, "bookmarked": false, "actions_summary": [], "moderator": false, "admin": false, "staff": false, "user_id": 11403, "hidden": false, "trust_level": 1, "deleted_at": null, "user_deleted": false, "edit_reason": null, "can_view_edit_history": true, "wiki": false, "mentioned_users": [], "post_url": "/t/gparted-dependencies/72200/4", "event": null, "reactions": [], "current_user_reaction": null, "reaction_users_count": 0, "current_user_used_main_reaction": false, "can_accept_answer": false, "can_unaccept_answer": false, "accepted_answer": false, "topic_accepted_answer": null}, {"id": 186467, "name": "Joe Walker", "username": "grumpey", "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/discussion.fedoraproject.org/grumpey/{size}/54040_2.png", "created_at": "2022-11-27T14:40:05.561Z", "cooked": "<p><code>sudo dnf rq --deplist packagename</code><br>\nProduces a list of dependencies and what package provides them.</p>\n<p><code>sudo dnf rq --requires packagename</code><br>\nProduces a list of the capabilities a package depends on</p>\n<p><code>sudo dnf rq --requires packagename --resolve</code><br>\nadding --resolve, resolves the capaiblity to a package name.</p>\n<p>ref: <a href=\"https://dnf.readthedocs.io/en/latest/command_ref.html#commands\" class=\"inline-onebox\">DNF Command Reference — dnf latest documentation</a></p>", "post_number": 5, "post_type": 1, "posts_count": 6, "updated_at": "2023-03-08T07:57:20.700Z", "reply_count": 0, "reply_to_post_number": 4, "quote_count": 0, "incoming_link_count": 2, "reads": 13, "readers_count": 12, "score": 27.6, "yours": false, "topic_id": 72200, "topic_slug": "gparted-dependencies", "display_username": "Joe Walker", "primary_group_name": "ask-fedora", "flair_name": null, "flair_url": null, "flair_bg_color": null, "flair_color": null, "flair_group_id": null, "badges_granted": [], "version": 2, "can_edit": false, "can_delete": false, "can_recover": false, "can_see_hidden_post": false, "can_wiki": false, "link_counts": [{"url": "https://dnf.readthedocs.io/en/latest/command_ref.html#commands", "internal": false, "reflection": false, "title": "DNF Command Reference — dnf latest documentation", "clicks": 0}], "read": true, "user_title": "Curious Penguin (Ask Fedora IV)", "title_is_group": false, "reply_to_user": {"id": 11403, "username": "udavidson", "name": "David Cooper", "avatar_template": "https://avatars.discourse-cdn.com/v4/letter/u/aad0ee/{size}.png"}, "bookmarked": false, "actions_summary": [{"id": 2, "count": 1}], "moderator": false, "admin": false, "staff": false, "user_id": 638, "hidden": false, "trust_level": 4, "deleted_at": null, "user_deleted": false, "edit_reason": null, "can_view_edit_history": true, "wiki": false, "mentioned_users": [], "post_url": "/t/gparted-dependencies/72200/5", "event": null, "reactions": [{"id": "heart", "type": "emoji", "count": 1}], "current_user_reaction": null, "reaction_users_count": 1, "current_user_used_main_reaction": false, "can_accept_answer": false, "can_unaccept_answer": false, "accepted_answer": false, "topic_accepted_answer": null}, {"id": 166991, "name": "Markos Malliarakis", "username": "marko23", "avatar_template": "https://avatars.discourse-cdn.com/v4/letter/m/aad0ee/{size}.png", "created_at": "2022-11-27T16:37:31.881Z", "cooked": "<p>Gparted isn’t the best GUI utility … try gnome-disk-utility with many features in top right corner button. LVM or BTRFS console command options go much further than Gparted with many online tips or simply man console command. A good ressource is Fedora Documentation : [<a href=\"https://docs.fedoraproject.org/en-US/docs/\" class=\"inline-onebox\">Fedora Documentation :: Fedora Docs</a>].</p>", "post_number": 6, "post_type": 1, "posts_count": 6, "updated_at": "2022-11-27T16:37:31.881Z", "reply_count": 0, "reply_to_post_number": null, "quote_count": 0, "incoming_link_count": 2, "reads": 12, "readers_count": 11, "score": 12.4, "yours": false, "topic_id": 72200, "topic_slug": "gparted-dependencies", "display_username": "Markos Malliarakis", "primary_group_name": null, "flair_name": null, "flair_url": null, "flair_bg_color": null, "flair_color": null, "flair_group_id": null, "badges_granted": [], "version": 1, "can_edit": false, "can_delete": false, "can_recover": false, "can_see_hidden_post": false, "can_wiki": false, "link_counts": [{"url": "https://docs.fedoraproject.org/en-US/docs/", "internal": false, "reflection": false, "title": "Fedora Documentation :: Fedora Docs", "clicks": 4}], "read": true, "user_title": null, "bookmarked